{%- comment -%}
===============================================================================
  Turn2Opinion — email system v1 ("the conversation")
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Template   : T6. Teen: create your password
  File       : minor-permitted-child.liquid
  Class      : Teen panel (transactional — no unsubscribe)
  Trigger    : The guardian finished consent; the Teen can set a password
  Tone       : mint
  Replaces   : minor-permitted-child.liquid

  SUBJECT LINES — pick one, or A/B them
    1. {{ user.name.first }}, you are in! Create your password
    2. You are approved
    3. Switch on your Teen account

  PREHEADER
    Your parent or guardian said yes. Create your password to switch on your account.

  PRIMARY CTA
    Create my password  ->  activate (or site/join/teen/?user=…&code=…&s=…&activate=1)

  PLAIN-TEXT ALTERNATIVE
    dist/text/minor-permitted-child.txt — send as the text/plain part of a multipart message.
    HTML-only mail is scored down by most spam filters.

  Generated from react/src/emails/teen-set.jsx — edit the JSX and re-run
  `npm run build`. Hand edits to this file are overwritten.

  Images are served from the base configured at build time; upload assets/
  there before sending. Serve over HTTPS from a stable path — clients do not
  retry a 404, so a moved asset breaks every copy already delivered.
===============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}
